          <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              We kicked off a new edition design which we aim to send to print in January 2026. It will be our best edition so far, with better-quality articles and a cleaner design for easier reading, while keeping our cool style.
            </p>
            
            <p>
              By featuring nomad celebrity people, we cover main destinations for nomads: <strong>Bansko</strong>, <strong>Madeira</strong>, <strong>Fukuoka</strong>, and potentially one more.
            </p>
            
            <p>
