            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>Brand Placement booking deadline:</strong> end of November 2025. <a href="/brand-placement-next-edition-847291" class="text-yellow-600 hover:text-yellow-700 underline font-semibold">Learn more about brand placement →</a>
            </p>

            <p>
              <strong>Have a question?</strong> Reach out at <a href="mailto:lera@nomadgossip.com" class="text-yellow-600 hover:text-yellow-700 underline font-semibold">lera@nomadgossip.com</a>
            </p>

            <div class="text-center mt-8">
              <a href="/brand-placement-next-edition-847291" class="inline-block bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-300 text-black px-6 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold transition-all duration-200">
                📰 Browse Brand Placement Options
